00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:04.890
Nicole: So why is it important to manage
and promote a positive digital identity?

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:08.430
Most people today have an
online digital identity.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.019
It is therefore important to
carefully manage and maintain it

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.820
professionally and keep it up to date.

00:00:15.549 --> 00:00:19.490
Abraham: It is always essential as a cyber
security professional to promote your

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.840
digital identity in a positive light.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.100
So, what exactly does a
digital identity consist of?

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.750
Nicole: Everything you do on the
internet be it publishing your own

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:35.509
social media posts, blogs or websites,
contributes to your digital footprint,

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:40.550
this also includes wherever your name
is mentioned when it is ‘Googled’.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:43.610
Abraham: When setting up your social
media channels, you should always

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.339
try to think about how you show
yourself by the name you use and

00:00:47.519 --> 00:00:49.059
the photographs that identify you.

00:00:49.069 --> 00:00:51.810
This can help to establish
your personal brand.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.869
Remember that any online content
out there will be accessible to

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:57.529
others for an indefinite period!

00:00:57.699 --> 00:01:01.449
Nicole: It’s also good to think
about any comment you make and

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.930
how you engage with others.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:07.050
Don’t say anything online that you
wouldn’t say in public and don’t show

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:10.960
any photos that you wouldn’t be happy
for your potential employer to see!

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:14.470
Abraham: Try and show yourself in
a professional light by setting

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:18.280
up a professional profile on
sites like LinkedIn and Twitter.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:22.430
You can also use these platforms
to follow appropriate companies and

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.489
look for recruitment opportunities
and potential employers.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:29.239
Nicole: Showcase the best version
of yourself and make professional

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:33.330
comments on current cyber security
issues and posts that relate to your

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.020
hobbies to enhance your employability.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.620
Abraham: Create bios that
reflect your skills and are

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.480
appropriate to potential roles.

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:44.599
Nicole: As a cyber security professional,
your digital identity, should really

00:01:44.599 --> 00:01:48.759
stand out as positive and professional
and show that you have nothing to hide!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:52.060
Abraham: Therefore, it is important
to always think carefully about

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:53.950
everything that you post or comment on.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:57.910
And remember that if you can find
your details out there then so can any

00:01:58.059 --> 00:01:59.959
third parties and potential employers.

